<title>USA: TAP Holdings ulcer treatment cleared by FDA.</title>
<headline>TAP Holdings ulcer treatment cleared by FDA.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>TAP Holdings Inc, a joint venture of Abbott Laboratories Inc and Takeda Chemical Industries Ltd, on Thursday said it received clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market Prevacid in combination with two other drugs to treatment of duodenal ulcers.</p>
<p>The two other drugs are clarithromycin and amoxicillin.</p>
</text>
